# Everything a build does not need, and several things it must not have.
#
# .env is the important one: it holds database credentials and the gateway secret, and
# a build context that includes it puts them in an image layer whether or not any
# instruction copies them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.venv
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.worktrees
artifacts
data
*.log
celerybeat-schedule*
